{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RHLW-2026-f5559edbddf93cd6","published":"2026-11-11T07:14:20Z","modified":"2026-11-13T16:13:19.028126968Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-44249","CVE-2026-45416","CVE-2026-50010","CVE-2026-75596","GHSA-3qp7-7mw8-wx86","GHSA-c653-97m9-rcg9","GHSA-fccg-mwvh-qqg4","GHSA-x4gw-5cx5-pgmh"],"summary":"Lightwell Security Advisory: netty-handler 4.2.13.Final-rhlw-00013","details":"Red Hat Lightwell has released io.netty:netty-handler 4.2.13.Final-rhlw-00013 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-44249, CVE-2026-45416, CVE-2026-50010, and CVE-2026-75596.\n\nCVE-2026-44249: Netty has an IPv6 Subnet Filter Bypass via Incorrect Comparator Masking\n\nCVE-2026-45416: Netty: SNI handler pre-allocates up to 16 MiB from nine attacker bytes\n\nCVE-2026-50010: Netty's wrapping plain trust manager silently disables hostname verification\n\nCVE-2026-75596: Netty: Fragmented ClientHello records trigger quadratic pre-handshake reassembly in default SNI parsing\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.netty:netty-handler 4.2.13.Final from Maven Central.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"io.netty:netty-handler","ecosystem":"Red Hat Lightwell:Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/io.netty/netty-handler"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"4.2.13.Final"},{"fixed":"4.2.13.Final-rhlw-00013"}]}],"versions":["4.2.13.Final"],"database_specific":{"lightwell":{"backport_base_version":"4.2.13.Final","remediated_version":"4.2.13.Final-rhlw-00013","repository_url":"https://packages.redhat.com/lightwell/java/remediated/"},"source":"https://github.com/project-lightwell/lightwell-osv/blob/main/advisories/RHLW-2026-f5559edbddf93cd6.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.1.135.Final"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.2.15.Final"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-44249.json"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redh